    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to present this beautiful one-bedroom, first-floor apartment to the market. Presented in very good condition throughout, this attractive property benefits from clean, neutral décor, an abundance of natural light, west-facing living accommodation, an easterly facing bedroom, and a recently upgraded electric eco-heating system.\n\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, bright kitchen/living/dining room, generous bedroom with ensuite, main bathroom, and a dedicated home office, making it an ideal choice for those working remotely.\n\nAn Crocán is a private, gated development ideally positioned just a short stroll from Clane Village, with its excellent range of shops, cafés, schools, sporting facilities, GAA grounds and Clane Hospital.\n\nClane also offers excellent commuter connectivity, with convenient access to both the M4 and M7 motorway networks, while Maynooth and Sallins train stations are both within a short driving distance.\n\nThis property would make an excellent first-time purchase, investment opportunity or home for a professional seeking a well-located apartment.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\nContact DNG McCormack Properties on 045 832535 to arrange your viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 2.71m x 0.95m\nLaminate flooring with sound proofing underlay, access to large attic space via staighre\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 5.34m x 5.14m\nLaminate flooring with sound proofing underlay, 2 windows, fully fitted kitchen units at floor and eye level, tv point\n\nBedroom - 3.50m x 3.08m\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, 2 windows\n\nBathroom - 2.11m x 2.08m\nCeramic tiled flooring and shower area, wc, whb, bath, Triton T80 electric shower, extractor\n\nOffice - 2.21m x 2.03m\nTimber flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious 1 bedroom first floor apartment</li><li> Very good condition</li><li> Upgraded electric eco heating system</li><li> West facing living areas</li><li> East facing bedroom</li><li> Timber/ ceramic/ carpeted flooring</li><li> Gated community</li><li> Allocated parking space</li><li> Management Company: Citadel</li><li> Management Fees: 1,530 per annum</li><li> Inclusions:</li><li> Carpets</li><li> Curtains</li><li> Blinds</li><li> Light Fittings</li><li> Cooker</li><li> Hob</li><li> Extractor</li><li> Fridge Freezer</li><li> Washing Machine</li><li> Most furniture included in sale if desired</ul>"
      },
